caption: Retention Depth at Mastery
tradition-component: retention-depth-at-mastery

Spawn Mastery does not turn the Tradition into Expanded Core. Gift Traits and Growth-Axis Root Traits still produce at most one retainable Spawn-trait generation. Spawn Traits may still produce temporary Manifestations, but those descendants cannot be permanently retained through Spawn unless another Tradition independently grants purchase access.
